window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Dive into a World of Celtic Myth and Dark Fantasy with <i>Cauldron of Dagda: The Witch's Rebirth, Book 2</i></p> <p>Prepare to be transported to a world steeped in ancient lore, shadowed by encroaching darkness, and ignited by a love that transcends time! Award-winning author Michaela Riley's <i>Cauldron of Dagda: The Witch's Rebirth, Book 2</i> is a compelling journey into the heart of dark epic fantasy, drawing inspiration from captivating Celtic myths and legends.</p> <p>Set in 540 A.D., a time of turmoil and uncertainty, the story plunges you into a world threatened by an ancient evil rising in the East. This darkness threatens to consume Constantinople and ultimately spell the end of humanity. In this desperate hour, Merona, known only as The Witch, must emerge from the shadows and embrace her destiny as humanity's last hope.</p> <p>Her mission: to protect the legendary Cauldron of Dagda, a powerful relic of the ancient Tuatha Dé Danann and a key to salvation. But she won't face this daunting task alone. By her side stands Murdach, a fierce immortal warrior and shapeshifting dragon, whose strength and loyalty are only surpassed by his unwavering love for Merona. A goddess of war and a wise seer further bolster her ranks as Merona prepares for a confrontation that will test her limits and force her to confront the echoes of her past.</p> <p>At the heart of this epic struggle lies a timeless love story. Murdach, her fated dragon warrior, is inextricably linked to the destiny she seeks to reclaim. As the darkness closes in, Merona feels an undeniable pull towards him, a flicker of hope igniting in her heart. But will her magic, the power of the Cauldron, and the strength of their bond be enough to combat the encroaching doom? Can she save humanity from the darkness?</p>"; 
